{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1280","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Cut and Paste"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We start with a string $$$s$$$ consisting only of the digits $$$1$$$, $$$2$$$, or $$$3$$$. The length of $$$s$$$ is denoted by $$$|s|$$$. For each $$$i$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$|s|$$$, the $$$i$$$-th character of $$$s$$$ is denoted by $$$s_i$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is one cursor. The cursor's location $$$\\ell$$$ is denoted by an integer in $$$\\{0, \\ldots, |s|\\}$$$, with the following meaning: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$\\ell = 0$$$, then the cursor is located before the first character of $$$s$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$\\ell = |s|$$$, then the cursor is located right after the last character of $$$s$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$0 \\lt \\ell \\lt |s|$$$, then the cursor is located between $$$s_\\ell$$$ and $$$s_{\\ell+1}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We denote by $$$s_\\text{left}$$$ the string to the left of the cursor and $$$s_\\text{right}$$$ the string to the right of the cursor. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We also have a string $$$c$$$, which we call our "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"clipboard"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", which starts out as empty. There are three types of actions:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Move action"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Move the cursor one step to the right. This increments $$$\\ell$$$ once. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Cut action"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Set $$$c \\leftarrow s_\\text{right}$$$, then set $$$s \\leftarrow s_\\text{left}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Paste action"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Append the value of $$$c$$$ to the end of the string $$$s$$$. Note that this doesn't modify $$$c$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The cursor initially starts at $$$\\ell = 0$$$. Then, we perform the following procedure:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Perform the Move action once. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Perform the Cut action once. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Perform the Paste action $$$s_\\ell$$$ times. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$\\ell = x$$$, stop. Otherwise, return to step 1. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You're given the initial string $$$s$$$ and the integer $$$x$$$. What is the length of $$$s$$$ when the procedure stops? Since this value may be very large, only find it modulo $$$10^9 + 7$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that $$$\\ell \\le |s|$$$ at any time."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line 